      "line": 48,
      "quote": "However, the use of coffee-scheme in various languages MAY be interpreted as an indication of the kind of coffee produced by the coffee pot.",
      "source": ".duvet/requirements/www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2324/section-3.toml",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2324",
      "target_section": "section-3",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The entity body of a POST or BREW request MUST be of Content-Type\n\"message/coffeepot\".\n",
      "id": "8ed599bd8c32e99c",
